  "description": "Connects the OASIS to WRLD3D -- a 3D geo-spatial mapping engine for visualising OASIS avatars, holons, and Our World/One World data in photorealistic 3D city models, indoor maps, and open-world environments. Supports Unity, Unreal, and web targets. Part of the OASIS HOT-Swappable Provider Architecture. Ecosystem: https://oasisomniverse.one",
